title: "The gate of one Game, written from the docs only"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Idle
    lg1: Busy
    lg2: Autoplay
    lg3: Breaks R02_ARunningJobKeepsItsEntry or R04_AnEndedRunStartsNoJob or R05_TheGameStaysIdleAfterAStop
    lg4: Breaks R03_ARunHoldsTheGameUntilItEnds or R10_ARunEndsOnAFailureOfItsOwnJobOnly in some cases
    lg5: Path to the R02_ARunningJobKeepsItsEntry or R03_ARunHoldsTheGameUntilItEnds or R04_AnEndedRunStartsNoJob or R05_TheGameStaysIdleAfterAStop or R10_ARunEndsOnAFailureOfItsOwnJobOnly bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: Idle
  s1: A run holds the Game between Jobs
  s2: A Job holds the Game
  s3: Idle#59; a stopped run's loop still runs
  s4: A run holds the Game between Jobs#59; a stopped run's loop still runs
  s5: A Job holds the Game#59; a stopped run's loop still runs
  s6: A run holds the Game, its Job starts#59; a stopped run's loop still runs
  s7: A Job holds the Game, narrating
  s8: Idle#59; a Job runs with no entry
  s9: Idle with a failure line
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start Autoplay
  s0 --> s2: you send an Action
  s1 --> s3: you press Stop
  s2 --> s2: the Job saves its Input
  s3 --> s4: you start Autoplay
  s3 --> s5: you send an Action
  s3 --> s6: the run starts its next Job
  s2 --> s7: the Job starts its next step
  s4 --> s0: the run finds another holder and ends
  s5 --> s8: the run finds another holder and ends
  s7 --> s7: the narrator call of the Job fails or the Job saves a failure line
  s7 --> s9: the engine restarts
  s9 --> s1: you start Autoplay
  s1 --> s9: the run ends
